The modifications are, in every case, a translation from Java to Rust, the
substitution of this workspace's typed frame, time-scale and element algebra
for Orekit's, and the generic-over-scalar rewrite that lets the same code carry
an automatic-differentiation type. Each file names the Orekit class it descends
from in its module documentation.

