--------------------------------------------------------------------------
What is NOT in this workspace
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Nothing here is derived from AGPL-licensed, SOFA-licensed or Numerical
Recipes material; CONTRIBUTING.md states the rule and the reasoning. Where a
model's reference implementation carries terms this workspace cannot accept,
the model is either implemented from the published mathematics with the data
supplied by the user at run time, or not implemented at all. docs/provenance.md
names each such case and what was decided.
